                        <p>Holden's 1802 James Gravel copperplate printer 4 Red Lion Court Fleet St.
                            Note that Godwin called (with Dawe) on two other copperplate printers
                            (Jones and Lahee) in the next three days after Gravel's call, but they
                            appeared in the diary only that once, and then a few days after Godwin
                            called on Gravel he began a series of six calls on Wilks (qv), ending in
                            call on Wilks (copy) two weeks later </p>
